<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/xapi-extension> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A custom property expressed in an xAPI extensions map using an IRI as the key and any JSON value or structure as the value. Extensions can appear in Activity Definitions, Statement Context, or Statement Result." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/xapi-extension/versions/1> .
